  "kdriveInfoBody": "1. Open the Infomaniak API token page (link below) and create a token with the drive scope.\n\n2. Open the kDrive web app and copy the number at the end of the URL: .../kdrive/app/drive/<number>. That number is the Drive ID.\n\n3. Paste the token and the Drive ID in this section and tap Connect. The token is stored encrypted on your server and is never shown to clients.\n\nNotes: the kDrive API allows about 60 requests per minute; metadata enrichment downloads only the first part of each image.",
